  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-5TO10-R7-028$qb$, $qb$A2-06$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$A team keeps missing the same information during handovers. Several local fixes have not prevented recurrence. What is the best first improvement?$qb$, $qb$Find why the information is being missed and fix that point in the handoff$qb$, $qb$Review several missed handovers for a common pattern$qb$, $qb$Add another reminder to the current process$qb$, $qb$Ask people to be more careful$qb$, $qb$Accept that handovers sometimes fail$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
